WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:07.970
The planet has been taken father.

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:14.190
The Third Eyed King pledges eternal loyalty
to your cause.

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:18.210
He accepted my terms?

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:19.210
Eventually.

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:22.220
Well done daughter.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.230
Well done.

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:26.240
Stop it!

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.240
Why?

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:45.539
By the look of it you seem content enough
at the time.

00:00:45.539 --> 00:00:49.239
I was a prisoner.

00:00:49.239 --> 00:00:53.910
You were a warrior.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:01:01.690
I didn't ask for it.

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:06.360
You didn't refuse.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:12.160
After my planet died I had nothing, no one.

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:15.790
And I thought I never would.

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:20.740
And I was alright with that, I had a new vocation.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:22.620
Then I found you.

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:31.250
And at my side you became the fiercest woman
in the galaxy.

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:36.770
That's why I chose you to find the Soul Stone.

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:40.140
I'm sorry I disappointed you.

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:48.080
I am disappointed, not because you didn't
find it.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:57.970
But because you did and you lied.

00:01:57.970 --> 00:01:59.720
I don't know what you're talking...

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:01.230
I gave you my trust!

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:03.700
You repaid it with deceit!

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:06.530
At least be honest about it now.

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:10.209
I could make you tell me.

00:02:10.209 --> 00:02:13.269
You seem to know that.

00:02:13.269 --> 00:02:24.329
I never wanted to force you into anything
That's why when you left me all those years

00:02:24.329 --> 00:02:25.769
ago I allowed it.

00:02:25.769 --> 00:02:26.769
You allowed it?

00:02:26.769 --> 00:02:29.230
You haven't been under the impression that
you escaped?

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:35.040
Daughter I raised us you smarter than that.

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:42.260
I'm not your daughter, you didn't raise me
you kidnapped me, orphaned me and imprisoned

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:43.260
me!

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:45.680
Everything I hate about myself comes from
you.

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:49.530
I stayed because you taught me I didn't deserve
better.

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:50.530
Why did you leave?

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:53.409
Because I found people that showed me I did.

00:02:53.409 --> 00:03:03.040
You had a family here little one.

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:07.160
No I dind't.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.530
Yes.

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:09.910
No.

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:20.909
You just didn't care what happened to it.

00:03:20.909 --> 00:03:22.950
Yippee-ki-yay movie lovers, it's Jan here.

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:26.970
With the Infinity War Blu-ray release we're
finally getting to see the movie's deleted

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:30.269
scenes and the one you just saw is one of
the things that the Russos were referring

00:03:30.269 --> 00:03:34.109
to when they said there was more backstory
for Thanos that got the chop from the finished

00:03:34.109 --> 00:03:35.109
film.

00:03:35.109 --> 00:03:39.150
This deleted scene takes place in the throne
room on Thanos's Sanctuary ship, and would

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:42.650
have occurred after Thanos took Gamora from
the Guardians, having tricked them with the

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:44.510
Reality Stone on Knowhere.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:48.650
OK let's look in more detail at some interesting
points in the deleted scene.

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:53.200
Notice that red flash there, well that's Thanos
using the Reality Stone to create a flashback

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:56.669
of sorts to remind Gamora what her life was
like with him.

00:03:56.669 --> 00:04:01.890
We get to see Gamora acting as one Thanos's
enforcers, exacting tributes from rulers.

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:05.700
She even brings him the head of a king who
presumably wouldn't acquiesce to Thanos's

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:06.700
demands.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:11.120
Gamora and Thanos's feelings about their shared
history are diametrically opposed.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:15.499
He sees Gamora as having become a warrior
thanks to him and she sees herself as having

00:04:15.499 --> 00:04:16.499
been his prisoner.

00:04:16.499 --> 00:04:20.780
Remember the actual movie only shows us Gamora
as a young child with Thanos.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:25.030
So this moment in the deleted scene is an
interesting bit of "show-rather-than-tell"

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.780
backstory for her character.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:31.590
As well as Thanos's warped view of their relationship,
the deleted scene also confirms how much he

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:36.600
views Gamora as his favourite daughter saying
that by his side she became the fiercest woman

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:37.970
in the galaxy.

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:41.910
We've seen and heard about this favouritism
before in the Guardians films and how painful

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:44.000
it was for Gamora's adoptive sister Nebula.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.665
That's why I trusted you to find the Soul
Stone.

00:04:45.665 --> 00:04:46.665
I'm sorry I disappointed you.

00:04:46.665 --> 00:04:50.820
I am disappointed, not because you didn't
find it.

00:04:50.820 --> 00:05:08.470
But because you did and you lied.

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:12.410
The beginning of the exchange between Thanos
and Gamora about the Soul Stone is almost

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:16.030
exactly the same in the deleted scene as it
is in the final movie.

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:18.700
That's why I chose you to find the Soul Stone.

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:22.140
I'm sorry I disappointed you.

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:29.910
I am disappointed, not because you didn't
find it.

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:40.160
But because you did and you lied.

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:44.400
However, after Thanos reveals that Gamora
lied to him about the Soul Stone, the deleted

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:48.780
scene continues with further details whereas
the final movie cuts immediately to Nebula

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.100
being tortured.

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:54.720
In this extended part of the deleted scene,
Thanos reveals that when Gamora left him back

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:58.840
in the first Guardians of the Galaxy movie,
she didn't escape as she believed, instead,

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:00.450
he allowed her to leave.

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:05.510
Gamora's reaction to Thanos calling her daughter
is basically the same as, but a bit longer

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.070
than, the version in the final film.

00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:10.150
Daughter I raised us you smarter than that.

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:15.650
I'm not your daughter, you didn't raise me
you kidnapped me, orphaned me and imprisoned

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:16.650
me!

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:19.210
Everything I hate about myself comes from
you.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:26.840
For a time you had that same will.

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:30.680
As you fought by my side daughter.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:33.020
I'm not your daughter.

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:37.700
Everything I hate about myself you taught
me.

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:45.430
The deleted scene ends differently with Thanos
portalling to where he's holding Nebula prisoner,

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:48.960
rather than opening a huge door as happens
in the actual movie.

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:52.520
When you compare this deleted scene to what
we saw in the final film, it actually feels

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:56.800
more like an alternate or extended scene than
a truly deleted scene.

00:06:56.800 --> 00:07:01.370
The scene in the movie had a much more dramatic
opening with Gamora tossing the food her father

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:05.990
brings her against his throne which immediately
and clearly reinforces the antagonism between

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:07.340
father and daughter.

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:11.990
The deleted scene also doesn't include the
moment where Thanos tells Gamora how her planet

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:14.970
is thriving ever since he killed half its
population.

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:18.700
We were happy on my home planet.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:19.700
Going to bed hungry?

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:21.040
Scrounging for scraps?

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:24.050
Your planet was on the brink of collapse.

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:26.040
I'm the one who stopped that.

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:28.450
You know what's happened since then?

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:34.570
The children born have known nothing but full
bellies and clear skies.

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:36.250
It's a paradise.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:39.930
Because you murdered half the planet.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:43.220
A small price to pay for salvation.

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:44.220
You're insane.

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:49.360
That's an important character moment for Thanos
as it shows the twisted logic he's constructed

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.740
for himself to justify his plan for the universe.

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:56.050
And, of course, it's also an important piece
of exposition for the audience to understand

00:07:56.050 --> 00:08:00.450
better what Thanos has in mind later when
he snaps his fingers and turns half of humanity

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:01.450
to dust.

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:05.520
So, although I think that bit of extra backstory
for Gamora would have also been interesting

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:10.920
to see in the movie, overall, the final version
we got was definitely more dramatic, snappier

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.150
and worked better.

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:16.170
It was also a bit shorter which I imagine
was another consideration for the Russo Brothers

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:18.950
given Infinity War's already long runtime.

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:23.960
By the way, originally, there were more Thanos
backstory scenes in an earlier Infinity War

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:24.960
script.

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:28.390
According to the screenwriters, a scene was
cut which showed how Thanos was rejected by

00:08:28.390 --> 00:08:31.360
his own people on his home planet of Titan.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:35.569
And another scene was chopped which showed
how the Mad Titan recruited the Black Order.

00:08:35.569 --> 00:08:39.140
So, what do you think about this bonus Thanos
and Gamora scene?

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:40.729
Would you like to have seen it in the movie?

00:08:40.729 --> 00:08:43.240
I'd love to hear your thoughts in the comments
below.

